{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And those who eat it.</b> Each one of those who eat it. And likewise וצדיקים ככפיר יבטח (and the righteous are bold as a young lion, Proverbs 28:1)." "<b>For he has profaned HaShem's holy portion.</b> After he has offered the fats on high, behold all the flesh is holy. And חלל is from the root חול, which has no meaning like חלל. And in this section the punishment of the sin is explained, and that soul shall be cut off."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:10:51.519655772Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}